yNotKept:`Your real name, email, address, phone number, library card number, school or location. There are no ads and no tracking.`,privacySeeTitle:`Who can see what`,privacySeeEveryone:`{b}Everyone{/b}, including the TV screen in the library, can see reader names, minutes, and which books were just read. They never see anything that says who you really are.`,privacySeeReviews:`{b}Reviews{/b} are only read by library staff. Staff may choose to show a review on the challenge page and TV screen, with your reader name. Please don’t write your real name, school or where you live in a review.`,privacySeeStaff:`{b}Library staff{/b} can see reader names, minutes, reading and reviews, so they can run the challenge, give bonus minutes and prizes, and remove anything unkind.`,privacyBooksTitle:`Books and covers`,privacyBooks:`Book titles and covers come from public book lists. When you search for a book that isn’t on our list yet, our server looks it up for you, and covers are copied to our own storage, so your device never contacts outside book websites.`,privacyStoredTitle:`Where it’s kept, and for how long`,privacyStored:`Everything is stored securely with our database provider, Supabase. Reading and reviews from this summer are cleared when the next season starts. Deleted accounts are erased 14 days after deletion.`,privacyChoicesTitle:`Your choices`,privacyChoiceDelete:`{b}Delete your account{/b} any time: there’s a link at the bottom of your page. Your name comes off the leaderboard and your tag stops working straight away. Everything is erased for good 14 days later. That gap means a library desk can undo it if it was a mistake, or if someone else used your tag.`,privacyChoiceUndo:`Made a mistake? You can remove reading you logged in the last 7 days.`,privacyChoiceAsk:`Questions, or want something changed? Ask at any library desk, or contact {library}.`,privacyParents:`Parents and caregivers: you’re welcome to ask us what’s stored for your child, or to have it deleted straight away.`,tagline:`Get lost in a book this summer!`,loginIntro:`Discover hidden worlds this summer with Kāpiti Libraries!`,loginTitle:`Scan your tag to start`,loginHelp:`Point your phone camera at the QR code on your reading tag. Or type the code printed under it.`,codeLabel:`Tag code`,cantReach:`We can’t reach the reading challenge right now. Check the internet is on, then try again.`,codePlaceholder:`ABCD-EFGH-JKMN-PQRS`,loginLive:`Kimi has walked {km} so far`,loginLiveSub:`Every minute you read keeps Kimi the Kiwi walking to Bluff.`,howItWorks:`How it works`,howText:`Building on last year’s challenge, this year come and pick up your login token from any Kāpiti Library. It’s loaded and ready to generate a fun username and start logging your reading! Use the dashboard to track your reading minutes, tautoko Kimi the Kiwi's lost-world adventure, try bonus challenges, submit book reviews and check out our Summer Reading activities calendar for so much more!`,kimi:`Kimi the Kiwi`,kimiHasWalked:`Thanks to everyone’s reading, Kimi has walked`,kimiStoryButton:`Kimi’s story`,kimiLetsGo:`Let’s go, Kimi!`,islandTitle:`Kimi’s Kāpiti Island climb`,islandHint:`Your own minutes walk Kimi from the beach to the very top of Kāpiti Island.`,mapIslandPin:`Kāpiti Island`,mapIslandWalk:`My island climb`,mapIslandOpen:`My climb up Kāpiti Island`,islandSummit:`Tūteremoana`,islandStartPlace:`Rangatira`,islandTrack:`Wilkinson Track`,islandClimbsNone:`Climb Kimi to the top of Tūteremoana! 🏔️`,islandClimbsOne:`You’ve climbed Tūteremoana once! 🏔️`,islandClimbsTwo:`You’ve climbed Tūteremoana twice! 🏔️`,islandClimbsMany:`You’ve climbed Tūteremoana {n} times! 🏔️`,islandClimbN:`Climb {n}`,islandPercent:`{pct}% of the way up`,islandUp:`{m} m up`,islandOfSummit:`of {m} m`,islandToTop:`{d} to the top`,islandAtBeach:`Kimi is on the beach at Rangatira, ready to climb.`,islandStart:`Read to wake Kimi up and start the climb!`,islandSummitDone:`Kimi reached the top of Tūteremoana! 🎉`,islandPaceClimb:`{minutes} minutes of reading climbs Kimi all the way to the top ({km} of track).`,islandPaceMetres:`Every minute you read walks Kimi {m} metres up the track.`,islandClimbers:`{n} readers have climbed Kimi up Tūteremoana!`,islandClimbers_1:`{n} reader has climbed Kimi up Tūteremoana!`,islandMapLabel:`Kāpiti Island seen from the beach, with the track from Rangatira to the top of Tūteremoana. Kimi is {m} metres up.`,islandM:`{n} m`,islandMapCredit:`Map data`,islandHeightCredit:`Heights`,islandLoadError:`The island map didn’t load. Try again soon.`,tvIslandClimbers:`{n} readers have climbed Kimi up Tūteremoana!`,tvIslandClimbers_1:`{n} reader has climbed Kimi up Tūteremoana!`,tvIslandClimbs:`{n} climbs to the top so far`,tvIslandNone:`Who’ll be the first to climb Kimi up Tūteremoana?`,tvIslandSub:`Every reader climbs their own Kimi: {km} from the beach to {m} m up`,tvIslandLabel:`Kāpiti Island`,kimiSays:`Kimi says:`,kimiDone:`Kimi made it to {finish} and returned the library book!`,kimiSayLogin:`Scan your tag and read to me!`,kimiSayHi:`Kia ora, {name}!`,kimiSayRead:`Read to me and I’ll keep walking! 📖`,kimiSayNext:`Next stop: {name}!`,kimiSayToGo:`Only {km} to go!`,kimiSaySleepy:`Yawn… a story would wake me up!`,kimiSayDone:`I made it! Thank you! 🎉`,kimiSayFerry:`Wheee, ferry ride! ⛴️`,kimiSayThanks:`Thanks for reading, Kāpiti! 💛`,kimiBookBack:`Back`,kimiBookNext:`Next`,kimiBookPage:`Page {n} of {count}`,kimiBookGoTo:`Go to page {n}`,kimiJourneyButton:`Kimi’s journey so far`,kimiChapter:`Chapter {n}`,kimiFindKicker:`Kimi’s find!`,kimiFunFact:`Fun fact`,kimiMomentFrom:`From Kimi’s journey`,kimiMomentMore:`And {n} more new finds are waiting in Kimi’s Lost World finds!`,kimiMomentMore_1:`And 1 more new find is waiting in Kimi’s Lost World finds!`,kimiBugs:`Kimi’s Lost World finds`,kimiBugsCount:`{n} of {total} found`,kimiBugsIntro:`Kiwi sniff out hidden creatures with the nostrils at the tip of their beak. Tap one of Kimi’s finds to read all about it!`,insectFactsTitle:`Did you know?`,insectFactsNext:`Another fact`,insectFactsCredit:`Facts: Manaaki Whenua – Landcare Research`,insectFact1:`About 18,000 kinds of insects in New Zealand live here and nowhere else in the world!`,insectFact2:`Most of our native insects live in the bush, so you usually have to go looking for them.`,insectFact3:`There are still insects in New Zealand that nobody has discovered or given a name yet. Maybe you will find one!`,insectFact4:`Insects have been around for at least 380 million years. That’s even before the dinosaurs!`,kimiBugMystery:`A mystery find at {name}`,kimiBugNext:`Keep reading to find out what Kimi finds at {name}!`,kimiBugsAll:`Kimi found every one! What a creature hunter!`,kimiBugNew:`New!`,kimiBugOpen:`{find}, found at {name}`,kimiJourneyEmpty:`Kimi’s journey is just starting. Keep reading to find out what happens!`,kimiJourneyMore:`To be continued… keep reading!`,tvLatestFind:`Kimi’s latest find`,tvFoundAt:`Found at {name}`,journeyPercent:`{pct}% of the way to {finish}`,todayNone:`Be the first to read today!`,kimiDoneSub:`Keep reading: Kimi’s walking back home for bonus kilometres!`,fromStart:`{km} from {start}`,walkedSub:`{minutes} minutes of reading · every minute is {m} metres`,walkedSub_1:`{n} minute of reading · every minute is {m} metres`,nextStop:`Next stop`,toGo:`{km} to go`,weMadeIt:`We made it to {finish}!`,reachedStop:`We reached {name}!`,stopReached:`Reached`,mapStopReached:`{name}, reached`,stopAhead:`{km} away`,home:`Home`,ferry:`On the ferry!`,wholeMap:`Whole map`,followWalker:`Follow us`,journeyMapLabel:`Map of Aotearoa showing how far the community has walked`,todayLine:`{minutes} minutes read today`,todayLine_1:`{n} minute read today`,readersLine:`{n} readers`,readersLine_1:`{n} reader`,myMinutes:`My minutes`,myWalk:`My walk`,dayStreak:`Day streak`,myRank:`My rank`,booksRead:`Books`,comparison:`About as far as {place}!`,logMyReading:`Log my reading`,logTitle:`Log my reading`,whatBook:`What are you reading?`,searchPla